  "question": {
    "text": "If the <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ….. [Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"\\&quot;|\\&quot;\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"\\&quot;normal\\&quot;\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> … [as <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>]</p>"
